  "cmd.sections.list.desc": "The section sets this installation holds, where each plugin's set stands, the mode, and the fixed one. A set is a named, ordered list of sections; a section is a view a plugin placed in a region.",
  "cmd.sections.create.desc": "Create an empty section set — put sections in it with sections.arrange, and stand it in a region with sections.link.",
